**Summary of the fix:**
- This patch ensures the tab is brought to the foreground before navigation, so FCP events are fired and Lighthouse can measure performance, even when run from the extension or DevTools. If `Page.bringToFront` is not supported, the error is ignored, so this is safe for CLI and other environments.
